1032:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  Sets the value for Aggregate characteristic. 
1033:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  All of the defined Digital characteristics with the Read property set be
1034:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  part of Aggregate (if available). The length of each of the Digital characteristics 
1035:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  that is part of the Aggregate is determined from the number of signals defined in the 
1036:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  Number of Digitals descriptor of the Digital characteristic. The Digital part byte 
1037:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  aligned and trailing bits (if any) set to 0. The order of the Digital characteristics 
1038:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  is determined by the value in the Description field of the Characteristic Presentation 
1039:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  Format descriptor with the lowest value first. 
1040:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  All of the defined Analog characteristics with Read property set part of the Aggregate
1041:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  (if available). The order of the Analog characteristics is determined by the value in 
1042:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  the Description field of the Characteristic Presentation Format descriptor with the 
1043:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  lowest value first. 
1044:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  The first analog input follows directly after the last Digital characteristic.
1045:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** * 
1046:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** * \return
1047:Generated_Source\PSoC4/BLE_1_aios.c **** *  A return value is of type CYBLE_GATT_ERR_CODE_T.
